      "content": "exactly. i don't want to be the person stumbling through the dark, trying to remember what the light felt like. i want to step away while the music is still ringing in my ears. it just feels so much more... right. like a graceful exit. like a final, perfect chord. don't you think there's something beautiful about knowing when to step out of the light?",
